sequenceDiagram
 title Sequence Diagram 1: User Sign-in
 actor User
 box Attraction Recommendation System
   participant WebApp
   participant Authentication
   participant UserDatabase
 end
 User->>WebApp: Submits login details
 Activate WebApp
 WebApp->>Authentication: Validates User
 Activate Authentication
 Authentication->>UserDatabase: Queries for User
 Activate UserDatabase
 UserDatabase-->>Authentication: Sends User Details Back(Username, Password)
 Deactivate UserDatabase
 Authentication-->>WebApp: Confirms user is Valid(UserValid)
 Deactivate Authentication
 WebApp->>User: Display successful login
 Deactivate WebApp
